- Long context: **not published.**
- Leak-grade claims (unverified): "huge leap over 6.1", "outperforms GPT-6 Astra" on front-end/creative work; no numeric scores attached.

### Why the file is excluded (evidence trail)

- Verified against primary sources on 2026-11-14: OpenAI news feed/RSS contains no GPT-6.2 item; no developer-docs model page exists for `gpt-6.2-sol`; the public model catalog still lists GPT-6.1 Sol as the mid-tier flagship.
- All coverage found is canary hands-on (Chinese tech media / community reviewers) with no measurable scores; numeric claims are anecdotal (quota consumption).
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` / `.agents/rules.md`, zero verified benchmark numbers for the exact ID → self-exclusion; no placeholder score invented.
